\name{IKUNML-package}
\alias{IKUNML-package}
\alias{IKUNML}
\docType{package}
\title{IKUNML: Configurable Machine Learning Feature Selection}
\description{
IKUNML wraps common machine learning feature-selection methods for omics-style
classification data. It provides a common input format, method-specific
parameter control, result export, and overlap summaries.
}
\details{
Supported methods include LASSO, Boruta, SVM-RFE, random forest, XGBoost, and
caret genetic algorithm feature selection.
}
